{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waking up in a small room you see a door, upon opening it you come to the realization that you have been kidnapped. When you come to your senses, you realize that you have to get out of this basement-like place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alert! After all, the person or... creature that kidnapped you is very close and may be waiting for you around the next corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to find your way out by avoiding collisions with the kidnapper and his traps, solving riddles and passing the tests that this mysterious place has left you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This place is really mysterious, in search of a way out you stumble upon more and more strange things and locations...</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Hotel?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2863800/e0d1b25b52e38fb94a468aa1528490ffbb0a485e.jpg"},{"name":"Demon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2863800/0ba77f7a26fee8ce6505299ce89d076d721c2219.jpg"},{"name":"The End","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2863800/82a69a72499dbdfb9dee7bc7a92f3f262b42d0bf.jpg"},{"name":"Crazy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2863800/74abd4afd78e20c73a8116edd11cbff918e91df4.jpg"},{"name":"Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2863800/b6e3946c6157a82aedf06cb19f682bd7c591b49c.jpg"},{"name":"Where am i?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2863800/b00750461f90e57f4923eb068ba7b015fb677e5e.jpg"},{"name":"Ancient thing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2863800/c369e33a519f269317d782e43bf1283567ac8349.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.aka